    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This modern five bedroomed detached dormer bungalow is ideally situated close to all local amenities and is just c.3 km from the M7 Motorway. \nThe property is located in a small, cul-de-sac development built in 2004. This well maintained home offers spacious, adaptable accommodation and includes an Entrance Hall, Living Room with solid fuel boiler stove, Dining Room, Kitchen with gas hob, Utility Room, Shower Room, Five Bedrooms, One En-Suite and Family Bathroom. The property was upgraded in 2022 to include new windows, interior doors, electrics and plumbing works.\nMains services. Dual solid fuel and oil fired central heating.\nOutside there is a concrete driveway offering ample parking to the front, and a private enclosed rear garden (not overlooked) in lawn with a cladded shed and timber garden shed. There is a concrete block boundary wall and timber boundary fence. \nThe property has the benefit of a low maintenance exterior brick finish and side pedestrian access to rear garden.\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.33m (7'8) x 4m (13'1)\nTiled Floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.3m (14'1) x 3.9m (12'10)\nWood flooring, Solid fuel boiler stove, Fireplace with wood surround, French doors to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 3.9m (12'10) x 3.45m (11'4)\nWood flooring, Patio door to rear garden\n\nKitchen - 3.65m (12'0) x 3.5m (11'6)\nTiled floor, Quality fitted kitchen, Gas hob, Electric oven\n\nUtility Room - 2.3m (7'7) x 2.3m (7'7)\nTiled floor, Fitted units, Plumbed for washing machine and dryer\n\nShower Room - 2.25m (7'5) x 1.2m (3'11)\nTiled wet room shower, Electric shower unit, WC, WHB\n\nBedroom 1 - 4m (13'1) x 3.5m (11'6)\nWood flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.45m (11'4) x 3.2m (10'6)\nWood flooring, Walk in wardrobe\n\nEn-Suite - 2.35m (7'9) x 2m (6'7)\nFully tiled, Shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.9m (12'10) x 3m (9'10)\nWood flooring, Rood window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.9m (9'6) x 2.8m (9'2)\nWood flooring\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.6m (8'6) x 2.4m (7'10)\nWood Flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.35m (7'9) x 1.9m (6'3)\nTiled floor, walls half tiled, Bath, WC, WHB, Vanity Unit, Roof Window\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
